div.p:
—A reiteration of the Soviet position on dealing with the ABM Treaty in a
                    separate agreement, and of the Soviet offer to discuss the threshold between
                    activities permitted and not permitted by the ABM Treaty;

—The view that the two sides seemed to be thinking along similar lines with
                    respect to suspect sites, with the U.S. to provide additional data, including
                    the criteria for identifying suspect sites;
